        "description_en": "<p><em><strong>Море Клинта</strong></em> (Clint's Sea) is a pirate game of exploration, trade, and conquest.  You must buy goods, take them away from other pirates, raid, and conquer other islands.</p>\n\n<p>The player who conquers all the islands wins.  In case of a tie, the most money wins.</p>\n\n<p><em>—user summary</em></p>",
